    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1114 PM EDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line extending from near Edinboro to near Franklin, moving east at 45 mph. HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Expect damage to trees and power lines. Locations impacted include... Corry, Edinboro, Titusville, Union City, Cambridge Springs, Waterford, Wattsburg, Riceville, Lincolnville, Canadohta Lake, Guys Mills, Cochranton, Saegertown, Hydetown, Mill Village, Blooming Valley, Townville, Spartansburg, Venango, and Elgin.",
